'''Neverending Cat Story''' (千里の道 ''Senri no Michi'', Lit. '''''Journey of a Thousand Miles''''') is the 11th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Although the game rates Neverending Cat Story's stages as 6-star-[[Stage Difficulties|difficulty]], these are some of the easiest 6-star stages in the game. All of the stages in this sub-chapter are just buffed copies of [[Passion Land]] stages. The enemies' strength magnifications are doubled, though this is not even a problem in the slightest. The stages might only be somewhat challenging in 4-Crown, where enemies are magnified by 3 times their original buffs.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

