==Trivia==
*Neverending Cat Story may be a reference to the book and movie ''[[wikipedia:The Neverending Story|The Neverending Story]]''.
*Neverending Cat Story's Japanese name, Senri no Michi (千里の道, "Journey of a Thousand Miles"), is taken directly from the proverb "Senri no michi mo ippo kara" (千里の道も一歩から, "A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step").
*Neverending Cat Story is the first sub-chapter not to introduce any new enemies.

